[
  {
    "filename": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical",
    "id": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical",
    "text": "半信半疑"
  },
  {
    "filename": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical-example-1",
    "id": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical-example-1",
    "text": "我聽到佢講嘅嘢有啲奇怪，真係半信半疑。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical-example-2",
    "id": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical-example-2",
    "text": "呢個消息未確定，你唔好完全信，應該半信半疑先得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical-example-3",
    "id": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical-example-3",
    "text": "佢講嗰啲政策聽落頭好，但我半信半疑佢哋真係會執行。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical-example-4",
    "id": "baan3seon3baan3ji4-skeptical-example-4",
    "text": "面試官對我嘅答案半信半疑，所以問多咗幾條問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily",
    "id": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily",
    "text": "步步高升"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily-example-1",
    "id": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily-example-1",
    "text": "恭喜你新工，祝你步步高升！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily-example-2",
    "id": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily-example-2",
    "text": "希望你嘅事業可以步步高升。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily-example-3",
    "id": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily-example-3",
    "text": "新年快樂，祝你步步高升，萬事如意！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily-example-4",
    "id": "bou6bou6goeng1soeng6-rise-steadily-example-4",
    "text": "只要努力，必定可以步步高升。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort",
    "id": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort",
    "text": "前功盡廢"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort-example-1",
    "id": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort-example-1",
    "text": "做咗咁耐嘅準備，最後全都前功盡廢，好唔開心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort-example-2",
    "id": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort-example-2",
    "text": "如果依家唔小心，之前嘅努力都會前功盡廢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort-example-3",
    "id": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort-example-3",
    "text": "佢因為一時嘅錯誤，整個計劃都前功盡廢咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort-example-4",
    "id": "cin4gung1zan1fai3-wasted-effort-example-4",
    "text": "我哋唔想前功盡廢，所以要加倍努力。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future",
    "text": "前途無量"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-1",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-1",
    "text": "你年輕有才華，真係前途無量。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-2",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-2",
    "text": "依家投資呢間公司，前途無量啊！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-3",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-3",
    "text": "學生仔努力讀書，前途無量。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-4",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-4",
    "text": "你嘅創意好正，前途無量啦！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted",
    "id": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted",
    "text": "全心一意"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted-example-1",
    "id": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted-example-1",
    "text": "我而家對你全心一意。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted-example-2",
    "id": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted-example-2",
    "text": "佢全心一意想做好份工。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted-example-3",
    "id": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted-example-3",
    "text": "如果你全心一意，冇嘢做唔到。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted-example-4",
    "id": "cing4sam1yat1ji3-wholehearted-example-4",
    "text": "佢對家庭全心一意，好有責任感。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical",
    "id": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical",
    "text": "充之有理"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical-example-1",
    "id": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical-example-1",
    "text": "你呢個講法充之有理，我都同意。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical-example-2",
    "id": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical-example-2",
    "text": "呢件事咁講，充之有理，所以我哋要小心處理。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical-example-3",
    "id": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical-example-3",
    "text": "雖然有難度，但佢嘅分析充之有理，值得參考。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical-example-4",
    "id": "cung1zi3jau5lei5-logical-example-4",
    "text": "你講得啱，充之有理，我哋應該採取行動。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising",
    "id": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising",
    "text": "發展有為"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising-example-1",
    "id": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising-example-1",
    "text": "佢工作做得好，有發展有為嘅前途。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising-example-2",
    "id": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising-example-2",
    "text": "呢個新科技項目發展有為，值得投資。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising-example-3",
    "id": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising-example-3",
    "text": "佢喺音樂方面發展有為，好有潛力。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising-example-4",
    "id": "faat3jam2jau5wai6-promising-example-4",
    "text": "公司嘅未來發展有為，大家都好期待。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit",
    "id": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit",
    "text": "快功快利"
  },
  {
    "filename": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit-example-1",
    "id": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit-example-1",
    "text": "佢哋想喺股市入面搵快功快利，所以炒得好頻密。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit-example-2",
    "id": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit-example-2",
    "text": "做生意唔好淨係追求快功快利，要穩紮穩打先得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit-example-3",
    "id": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit-example-3",
    "text": "快功快利雖然吸引，但有時會帶嚟風險同損失。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit-example-4",
    "id": "foi3gong1foi3lei6-quick-profit-example-4",
    "text": "年輕人想快功快利，可能唔夠經驗應付複雜情況。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned",
    "id": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned",
    "text": "辛苦得來"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned-example-1",
    "id": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned-example-1",
    "text": "呢個獎狀係我辛苦得來嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned-example-2",
    "id": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned-example-2",
    "text": "佢嘅成功係辛苦得來，唔係一帆風順。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned-example-3",
    "id": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned-example-3",
    "text": "我哋嘅友誼係辛苦得來，唔會輕易放棄。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned-example-4",
    "id": "gai3gung1lei6dak1-hard-earned-example-4",
    "text": "呢份工係辛苦得來，要好好珍惜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead",
    "id": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead",
    "text": "未雨綢繆"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead-example-1",
    "id": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead-example-1",
    "text": "公司喺開新項目前，一定要未雨綢繆，做好風險評估。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead-example-2",
    "id": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead-example-2",
    "text": "我哋應該未雨綢繆，睇清楚所有可能出現嘅問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead-example-3",
    "id": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead-example-3",
    "text": "做生意冇得即興，最緊要係未雨綢繆。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead-example-4",
    "id": "gai3ho2gei3hak1-plan-ahead-example-4",
    "text": "家庭理財最好係未雨綢繆，免得遇到蛇況突然唔知點算。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows",
    "id": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows",
    "text": "今次唔知"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows-example-1",
    "id": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows-example-1",
    "text": "今次唔知，下次一定冇問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows-example-2",
    "id": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows-example-2",
    "text": "你唔使擔心，今次唔知，未來點都好。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows-example-3",
    "id": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows-example-3",
    "text": "今次唔知，可能下次會好啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows-example-4",
    "id": "gam1ci1m4zi1-next-time-who-knows-example-4",
    "text": "佢今次失敗咗，但係今次唔知，下次一定成功。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event",
    "id": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event",
    "text": "舉足輕重"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event-example-1",
    "id": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event-example-1",
    "text": "喺公司度，佢嘅意見嘅舉足輕重，大家都好尊重佢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event-example-2",
    "id": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event-example-2",
    "text": "呢個問題中，政府嘅角色舉足輕重，決定咗整件事嘅走向。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event-example-3",
    "id": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event-example-3",
    "text": "依家競選期間，呢幾個候選人嘅策略舉足輕重，可能改變選舉結果。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event-example-4",
    "id": "geoi2cuk1zing3jung6-grand-event-example-4",
    "text": "呢家嘅技術進步對行業發展有舉足輕重嘅影響。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed",
    "text": "見怪不怪"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-1",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-1",
    "text": "經過咁多磨鍊，佢真係見怪不怪喇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-2",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-2",
    "text": "喺呢行做咗咁耐，見怪不怪都係必須嘅心態。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-3",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-3",
    "text": "面對啲咁奇怪嘅嘢，佢依然見怪不怪，真係好厲害。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-4",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-4",
    "text": "我哋見怪不怪，因為城市生活有時候就係咁多變。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech",
    "text": "講不清楚"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-1",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-1",
    "text": "你啱啱講嘅嘢有啲講不清楚，可以再解釋多啲嗎？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-2",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-2",
    "text": "佢講不清楚，令我完全聽唔明。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-3",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-3",
    "text": "如果你講不清楚，可能會造成誤會。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-4",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-4",
    "text": "我哋要避免講不清楚，確保資訊傳達得清晰。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard",
    "id": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard",
    "text": "埋頭苦幹"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard-example-1",
    "id": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard-example-1",
    "text": "佢呢幾個月埋頭苦幹，終於完成咗個大項目。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard-example-2",
    "id": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard-example-2",
    "text": "遇到困難嘅時候，唔好灰心，要繼續埋頭苦幹。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard-example-3",
    "id": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard-example-3",
    "text": "老師話，要成功就要埋頭苦幹，唔好畀誘惑分心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard-example-4",
    "id": "gung1zing3cin4fat6-work-hard-example-4",
    "text": "啲工人埋頭苦幹，確保工程按時完成。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky",
    "id": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky",
    "text": "挑三揀四"
  },
  {
    "filename": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky-example-1",
    "id": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky-example-1",
    "text": "佢喺嗰啲顏色度挑三揀四，最後都決定唔到。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky-example-2",
    "id": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky-example-2",
    "text": "你唔好挑三揀四啦，快啲揀一樣嘢食喇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky-example-3",
    "id": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky-example-3",
    "text": "老闆嫌員工挑三揀四唔願意做額外嘅工作。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky-example-4",
    "id": "haau2go3bat1geoi3-picky-example-4",
    "text": "喺搵伴侶嘅時候，唔好挑三揀四，要理性啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale",
    "id": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale",
    "text": "氣勢磅礡"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale-example-1",
    "id": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale-example-1",
    "text": "嗰場音樂會氣勢磅礡，令人難以忘懷。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale-example-2",
    "id": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale-example-2",
    "text": "大自然嘅氣勢磅礡令人感到好渺小。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale-example-3",
    "id": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale-example-3",
    "text": "呢幅畫表現出一種氣勢磅礡嘅氣氛。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale-example-4",
    "id": "hei3si3pang4bong6-impressive-scale-example-4",
    "text": "佢嘅演講充滿氣勢磅礡嘅力量，令全場震撼。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-good-start",
    "id": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-good-start",
    "text": "開門紅利"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-good-start-example-1",
    "id": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-good-start-example-1",
    "text": "新年做生意，真係希望有個開門紅利。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-good-start-example-2",
    "id": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-good-start-example-2",
    "text": "佢喺新公司做得幾好，真係開門紅利。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-good-start-example-3",
    "id": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-good-start-example-3",
