    "id": "king1sing4soeng1joeng6-relieved",
    "text": "輕鬆自在"
  },
  {
    "filename": "king1sing4soeng1joeng6-relieved-example-1",
    "id": "king1sing4soeng1joeng6-relieved-example-1",
    "text": "我喺度飲啤酒，真係輕鬆自在。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "king1sing4soeng1joeng6-relieved-example-2",
    "id": "king1sing4soeng1joeng6-relieved-example-2",
    "text": "做完功課之後，我覺得輕鬆自在好多。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "king1sing4soeng1joeng6-relieved-example-3",
    "id": "king1sing4soeng1joeng6-relieved-example-3",
    "text": "假期入面，最緊要係令自己輕鬆自在。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "king1sing4soeng1joeng6-relieved-example-4",
    "id": "king1sing4soeng1joeng6-relieved-example-4",
    "text": "你講嘅嘢咁輕鬆自在，令我都想試吓。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win",
    "id": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win",
    "text": "兩全其美"
  },
  {
    "filename": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win-example-1",
    "id": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win-example-1",
    "text": "我哋搵到個方法，真係兩全其美，大家都有好處。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win-example-2",
    "id": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win-example-2",
    "text": "呢個計劃兩全其美，既可以節省時間，又唔會增加成本。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win-example-3",
    "id": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win-example-3",
    "text": "我哋諗住選擇兩全其美嘅方案，唔使犧牲任何一方。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win-example-4",
    "id": "loeng5cyun4kei4mei5-win-win-example-4",
    "text": "頭先嗰個提議真係做咗兩全其美，大家都滿意。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret",
    "id": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret",
    "text": "明爭暗鬥"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret-example-1",
    "id": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret-example-1",
    "text": "公司裏面上下層之間明爭暗鬥，好難睇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret-example-2",
    "id": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret-example-2",
    "text": "政壇上一向都係明爭暗鬥，好多計謀。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret-example-3",
    "id": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret-example-3",
    "text": "佢哋嘅關係表面好似朋友，背後一早開始明爭暗鬥。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret-example-4",
    "id": "ming4zaang1on3dou6-open-and-secret-example-4",
    "text": "公司內部因為升職問題，經常明爭暗鬥。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless",
    "id": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless",
    "text": "無可奈何"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless-example-1",
    "id": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless-example-1",
    "text": "當時我真係無可奈何，淨係可以接受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless-example-2",
    "id": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless-example-2",
    "text": "面對呢個嚴重嘅問題，我哋真係無可奈何。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless-example-3",
    "id": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless-example-3",
    "text": "有時候，你只能無可奈何咁放低佢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless-example-4",
    "id": "mou4ho2noi6ho4-helpless-example-4",
    "text": "佢哋對局勢感到無可奈何，冇辦法改變。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken",
    "id": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken",
    "text": "心如刀割"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken-example-1",
    "id": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken-example-1",
    "text": "當我聽到佢離開嘅消息，即刻心如刀割。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken-example-2",
    "id": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken-example-2",
    "text": "失去好朋友之後，我真係心如刀割，一日唔想出門。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken-example-3",
    "id": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken-example-3",
    "text": "佢講完嗰段說話，令我心如刀割，好難過。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken-example-4",
    "id": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-heartbroken-example-4",
    "text": "見到家人咁受苦，我心如刀割，但無辦法幫佢哋。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind",
    "text": "心中有數"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-1",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-1",
    "text": "唔使擔心，我心中有數，呢件事一定做得好。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-2",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-2",
    "text": "佢話唔通知我，但我心中有數佢嚟唔嚟。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-3",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-3",
    "text": "你考試前要做好準備，心中有數先得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-4",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-4",
    "text": "做生意嘅時候，心中有數可以幫你避免損失。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result",
    "text": "水到渠成"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result-example-1",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result-example-1",
    "text": "只要你勤力學習，水到渠成，考試一定會取得好成績。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result-example-2",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result-example-2",
    "text": "呢個計劃已經準備得好充足，水到渠成就係時間問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result-example-3",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result-example-3",
    "text": "唔使擔心，努力工作，水到渠成嘅時候自然會有收穫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result-example-4",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-result-example-4",
    "text": "佢哋嘅合作好融洽，水到渠成自然開展咗新項目。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight",
    "text": "水洩不通"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-1",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-1",
    "text": "地鐵繁忙時間真係水洩不通，好難走得快。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-2",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-2",
    "text": "演唱會入面水洩不通，大家都擠埋一齊睇表演。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-3",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-3",
    "text": "辦公室今日水洩不通，因為有好多客人嚟開會。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-4",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-4",
    "text": "節日市場水洩不通，行街要好小心唔好遺失嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change",
    "text": "時過境遷"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-1",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-1",
    "text": "我哋以前成日一齊玩，但係而家時過境遷，大家都冇咁多時間。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-2",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-2",
    "text": "時過境遷，公司嘅文化同以前完全唔同咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-3",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-3",
    "text": "我明白你嘅感受，但係時過境遷，唔好再計較啲舊事啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-4",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-4",
    "text": "時過境遷，以前嘅承諾可能唔再適用於今日。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both",
    "id": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both",
    "text": "雙輸局面"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both-example-1",
    "id": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both-example-1",
    "text": "如果雙方唔肯妥協，呢個談判就會變成雙輸局面。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both-example-2",
    "id": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both-example-2",
    "text": "爭持唔下只會令雙輸局面更加嚴重。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both-example-3",
    "id": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both-example-3",
    "text": "政府同反對派嘅爭拗令雙輸局面難以避免。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both-example-4",
    "id": "soeng1daan1zoeng3lei6-lose-both-example-4",
    "text": "如果我哋唔合作，呢個生意就會係雙輸局面。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help",
    "id": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help",
    "text": "相濡以沫"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help-example-1",
    "id": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help-example-1",
    "text": "喺呢個艱難時期，我哋要相濡以沫，一齊堅持落去。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help-example-2",
    "id": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help-example-2",
    "text": "佢哋夫妻之間一直相濡以沫，面對生活嘅困難都唔放棄。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help-example-3",
    "id": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help-example-3",
    "text": "喺呢班團隊入面，大家相濡以沫，合作無間。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help-example-4",
    "id": "soeng1soeng1ji2sau2-mutual-help-example-4",
    "text": "面對逆境，朋友間嘅相濡以沫更加珍貴。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting",
    "text": "生生不息"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting-example-1",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting-example-1",
    "text": "自然界嘅能量係生生不息，永不停歇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting-example-2",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting-example-2",
    "text": "我哋嘅傳統文化要生生不息，代代相傳。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting-example-3",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting-example-3",
    "text": "希望我哋嘅友誼可以生生不息，永遠保持住。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting-example-4",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6bat1dik1-everlasting-example-4",
    "text": "地球嘅生命力係生生不息，帶畀我哋好多驚喜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier",
    "text": "上上之選"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier-example-1",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier-example-1",
    "text": "呢件外套真係上上之選，質料同設計都好正。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier-example-2",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier-example-2",
    "text": "你想搵一個上上之選嘅手機，我可以介紹幾款俾你。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier-example-3",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier-example-3",
    "text": "呢間餐廳嘅招牌菜絕對係上上之選，唔試真係蝕底。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier-example-4",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6jan4soeng6-top-tier-example-4",
    "text": "如果你想投資，優質股票永遠係上上之選。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice",
    "text": "上上之選"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice-example-1",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice-example-1",
    "text": "呢部手機係我覺得上上之選，質量同價錢都一流。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice-example-2",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice-example-2",
    "text": "如果你想搵最穩陣嘅投資，上上之選就係呢隻基金。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice-example-3",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice-example-3",
    "text": "我哋餐廳嘅新菜好受歡迎，好多客人都話係上上之選。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice-example-4",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-top-choice-example-4",
    "text": "喺咁多手機裏面，呢部真係上上之選，唔好錯過。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future",
    "id": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future",
    "text": "尚未可知"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future-example-1",
    "id": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future-example-1",
    "text": "呢單買賣嘅結果尚未可知，大家都要保持耐心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future-example-2",
    "id": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future-example-2",
    "text": "疫情下嘅經濟復甦尚未可知，企業要做好準備。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future-example-3",
    "id": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future-example-3",
    "text": "佢哋嘅合作能否成功尚未可知。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future-example-4",
    "id": "soeng6wai6loi4-uncertain-future-example-4",
    "text": "呢個計劃嘅未來發展尚未可知，仲需要多啲調查。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated",
    "id": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated",
    "text": "天注定"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated-example-1",
    "id": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated-example-1",
    "text": "我哋啲相遇真係天注定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated-example-2",
    "id": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated-example-2",
    "text": "唔使擔心，呢啲嘢都係天注定嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated-example-3",
    "id": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated-example-3",
    "text": "你諗下，如果係天注定，我哋就接受啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated-example-4",
    "id": "tin1ji1gei3jap6-fated-example-4",
    "text": "佢依加走咗，我覺得係天注定嘅安排。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless",
    "text": "天衣無縫"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-1",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-1",
    "text": "佢嘅演講真係天衣無縫，冇人能夠反駁。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-2",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-2",
    "text": "呢套設計天衣無縫，完全冇錯漏。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-3",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-3",
    "text": "佢哋合作得咁好，計劃簡直天衣無縫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-4",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-4",
    "text": "寫手嘅文筆非常流暢，文句天衣無縫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect",
    "text": "天衣無縫"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect-example-1",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect-example-1",
    "text": "佢嘅答辯真係天衣無縫，令所有人都無法反駁。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect-example-2",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect-example-2",
    "text": "呢幅畫嘅構圖同色彩都天衣無縫，好難搵到缺點。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect-example-3",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect-example-3",
    "text": "佢哋嘅合作默契天衣無縫，專案先至成功。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect-example-4",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-perfect-example-4",
    "text": "嗰套劇本嘅情節設計真係天衣無縫，好吸引觀眾。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous",
    "text": "自以為是"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-1",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-1",
    "text": "佢成日自以為是，唔聽我哋嘅建議。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-2",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-2",
    "text": "唔好咁自以為是，大家都有自己嘅路。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-3",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-3",
    "text": "佢自以為是，以為自己最叻，結果都出錯。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-4",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-4",
    "text": "有啲人自以為是，唔願接受批評。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict",
    "id": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict",
    "text": "自相矛盾"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict-example-1",
    "id": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict-example-1",
    "text": "佢講嘢成日自相矛盾，唔知佢講緊乜嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict-example-2",
    "id": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict-example-2",
    "text": "你咁樣講，其實係自相矛盾喎。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict-example-3",
    "id": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict-example-3",
    "text": "佢嘅說法自相矛盾，唔可以信佢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict-example-4",
    "id": "zi6soeng2zi6waa6-self-contradict-example-4",
    "text": "寫呢篇文章嘅時候，我發現咗好多自相矛盾嘅地方。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted",
    "text": "自作自受"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-1",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-1",
    "text": "你唔聽我講依家好辛苦，都係自作自受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-2",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-2",
    "text": "佢唔負責任，結果搞到咁，大概都係自作自受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-3",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-3",
    "text": "今日嘅低分係因為你無準備，真係自作自受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-4",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-4",
    "text": "你遲到成日俾罰款，真係自作自受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient",
    "id": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient",
    "text": "事半功倍"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient-example-1",
    "id": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient-example-1",
    "text": "用左新嘅軟件之後，工作效率提升，真係事半功倍。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient-example-2",
    "id": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient-example-2",
    "text": "學習時用啱方法，成績可以事半功倍。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient-example-3",
    "id": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient-example-3",
    "text": "團隊合作得好，效率自然事半功倍。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient-example-4",
    "id": "zit6ho2zing3lei5-efficient-example-4",
    "text": "佢搵到啱嘅策略，做嘢真係事半功倍。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around",
    "id": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around",
    "text": "種瓜得瓜"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around-example-1",
    "id": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around-example-1",
    "text": "你咁努力，當然係種瓜得瓜啦。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around-example-2",
    "id": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around-example-2",
    "text": "唔好只想攞好處，種瓜得瓜嘛。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around-example-3",
    "id": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around-example-3",
    "text": "做人要誠實，種瓜得瓜，撒錯嘅種，收錯嘅果。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around-example-4",
    "id": "zung1zi2jau5bou3-what-goes-around-example-4",
    "text": "家庭教育好重要，種瓜得瓜，後生仔成日會記住。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zyu1zi1zung3cing4-heavy-impact",
    "id": "zyu1zi1zung3cing4-heavy-impact",
    "text": "舉足輕重"
  },
  {
